# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated datasets -- deliberately NOT committed.
#
# These files are 247 MB each, which exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# More importantly, they are fully REGENERABLE: every random number in this
# project is seeded, so anyone can rebuild the exact same dataset with
#
#     python data_generation.py --n-per-class 600 --profile realistic
#
# Committing derived data that a script can reproduce byte-for-byte is worse
# practice than committing the script. Ship the recipe, not the cake.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*.npy
data/*.json

# Trained model weights -- also regenerable, and large.
results/*.pt

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# LaTeX build artefacts
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.toc

# OS clutter
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
OUTREACH_EMAILS.md
